00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.350
Yeah. Everything is getting
pretty hot, and loose,

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:33.230
and the light's running

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.147
out of battery.
Feel this.

00:12:34.147 --> 00:12:36.026
And you could fry an egg on that.

00:12:36.026 --> 00:12:37.410
That is so hot! Isn't it hot?

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.630
I think we got some
almost very good stuff.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.080
