ahold of motion control.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.770
A bit of mo-co, what do you think Dan?

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:46.603
Yeah I think so.

00:12:46.603 --> 00:12:48.030
It'd make my job easier and your job.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:53.030
Yeah let's get this phantom
off this poor tripod head.

00:12:54.394 --> 00:12:57.440
I really like the footage we got.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:00.785
Although, a deceptively
exhausting video to make.

00:13:00.785 --> 00:13:02.860
