00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.000
and shine a couple of lights.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.750
But anything with timing
is mentally frustrating.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.460
And with all this it was like
an eventual sort of workout,

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.630
having to suspend the weight
and drop it and catch it

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:14.463
